| `commit_subject.types` | list of strings | `["feat", "fix", "docs", "test", "refactor", "ci", "chore", "style", "perf", "release"]`; required in the loader | non-empty and unique lowercase words, each a letter then letters or digits | `scripts/commit_subject.py`; `tests/integration/test_work_trailers.py` | Closed vocabulary for the subject type. | commit bodies and trailers | always |
